OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Murrell's legal aid
OL,4,Awithdrawn after embezzlement conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer SNP chief executive Peter
OL,7,FMurrell, who was jailed in June for
OL,8,Fembezzling more than #400,000 from the
OL,9,Fparty, has had his legal aid withdrawn.
OL,11,FMurrell, the estranged husband of
OL,12,Fex-First Minister Nicola Sturgeon, was
OL,13,Fsentenced to five years after using the
OL,14,Ffunds to buy goods ranging from a
OL,15,Fluxury motorhome to toiletries.
OL,17,FHe was granted legal aid -
OL,18,Fgovernment-funded assistance typically
OL,19,Fgiven to people who cannot afford it -
OL,20,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
